Subject: [PATCH] scripts: recognize current Vulkan platform guards

Vulkan-Headers now defines Open Harmony OS and UBM platform extensions.
Use their registry protection macros when generating the JSON layer.

Upstream-Status: Pending

--- a/scripts/common_codegen.py
+++ b/scripts/common_codegen.py
@@ -64,6 +64,8 @@
     'provisional' : 'VK_ENABLE_BETA_EXTENSIONS',
     'directfb' : 'VK_USE_PLATFORM_DIRECTFB_EXT',
     'screen' : 'VK_USE_PLATFORM_SCREEN_QNX',
+    'ohos' : 'VK_USE_PLATFORM_OHOS',
+    'ubm' : 'VK_USE_PLATFORM_UBM_SEC',
 }
 
 #
